<title>USA: Powerwave gets $14 mln in orders.</title>
<headline>Powerwave gets $14 mln in orders.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Powerwave Technologies Inc, a manufacturer of ultra-linear radio frequency power amplifiers to the wireless communications industry, said it has received $14 million in new orders.</p>
<p>The new orders have been received from Hyundai Electronics Industries Co Ltd, LG Information &amp; Communications Co Ltd and Samsung Electronics Co Ltd, it said.</p>
<p>(-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
</text>
